Z||000001||87ECO5||08-22-2000||09:34 AM||||He never said what he did with that second check!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Actually, I was experiencing deja vu when I read this story.  My mother-in-law was having some major problems with her '98 Vette.  In fact, you could just about flip-flop "Impala" with "Corvette" and "autotrac/air bag" with "traction control" and have an <B>identical</B> story.<P>However, the story would have been much shorter, as she accepted GM's offer for an extended warranty.  Fortunately, she's not experienced any more problems with it [knocking frantically on wood]!!!||||reg||6
